PN,36101
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham is
OL,7,Fexpected to unveil an #8.4 billion
OL,8,Finvestment for nuclear submarines to
OL,9,Fget the new HMS Dreadnought through
OL,10,Fits sea trials and ready for service
OL,11,Fby the 2030s.
OL,13,FThe nuclear-armed submarines are set
OL,14,Fto replace the current Vanguard Class
OL,15,Fwhen they enter service and will be
OL,16,Fcapable of launching Trident 2 D5
OL,17,Fballistic missiles.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FBarrow is the biggest winner with
OL,7,F13,500 jobs expected to be supported
OL,8,Fby the wider UK Defence Nuclear
OL,9,FEnterprise. It is expected to support
OL,10,Faround 47,000 jobs across the UK in
OL,11,Ftotal.
OL,13,FThe submarines will be powered by a
OL,14,FRolls-Royce nuclear propulsion system,
OL,15,Fproduced in Derby, giving them almost
OL,16,Funlimited range.
OL,18,FHMS Dreadnought is the first of four
OL,19,Fnew nuclear submarines.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FWhile the money will support the first
OL,7,Fboat's progress towards being ready
OL,8,Ffor service, some of the cash will go
OL,9,Ftowards getting the second boat, HMS
OL,10,FValiant, to its sea trials phase.
OL,12,FManufacturers will also be supported
OL,13,Fto get the third and fourth boats
OL,14,Fthrough their construction phases.
OL,16,FOn the Dreadnought Class submarine
OL,17,Fprogramme, #5.9 billion of the #8.4
OL,18,Fbillion will go to BAE Systems, with
OL,19,F#2.5 billion for the wider supply
OL,20,Fchain.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FAndy Burnham said: "Keeping this
OL,7,Fcountry safe is the first
OL,8,Fresponsibility of any Government. But
OL,9,Fsecurity is not only about what we
OL,10,Fbuild, it is about who builds it, and
OL,11,Fwho benefits from it."
OL,13,FHe said the submarines would be built
OL,14,Fby British workers and British firms,
OL,15,Fin places that were "written off for
OL,16,F40 years".
OL,26,@nD@TOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,F"To every young person across the
OL,7,Fcountry, I want you to know that there
OL,8,Fis a path for you into a
OL,9,Freindustrialised Britain and it starts
OL,10,Fwith the apprenticeships we are
OL,11,Ffunding through this investment
OL,12,Ftoday," he added.
OL,14,FIt is thought the Prime Minister will
OL,15,Fhail Barrow as a case study for how
OL,16,Ftaxpayer investment in major
OL,17,FGovernment projects can support
OL,18,Fopportunities in the long term
OL,19,Fthroughout the UK.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FDefence Secretary Wes Streeting said:
OL,7,F"Our nuclear-armed submarines are
OL,8,Fessential to keeping the UK secure,
OL,9,Facting as the ultimate deterrent to
OL,10,Four adversaries in an increasingly
OL,11,Fdangerous world.
OL,13,F"This milestone investment breathes
OL,14,Fnew life into Barrow's historic
OL,15,Ftraditions and secures our commitment
OL,16,Fto deliver Dreadnought Class
OL,17,Fsubmarines by backing British
OL,18,Findustry."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister's announcement on
OL,7,FThursday, 30 July, will follow his
OL,8,Fpledge to tackle joblessness among
OL,9,Fyoung people.
OL,11,FBurnham faces questions about his
OL,12,Fdefence policies, including how he
OL,13,Fwill pay for a commitment to reach
OL,14,F3.5% of GDP on defence spending by
OL,15,F2035.
OL,17,FAsked at a press conference whether he
OL,18,Fwould meet the commitment, the Prime
OL,19,FMinister pointed to the deadline in
OL,20,Fthe next decade.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,F"In terms of our NATO commitments, I
OL,7,Fhave been very clear that we will
OL,8,Fhonour those commitments," he said.
OL,9,F"It does mean being prepared to look
OL,10,Fat challenging issues."
OL,12,FChancellor John Healey, who resigned
OL,13,Fas Sir Keir Starmer's defence
OL,14,Fsecretary in June, warned that the
OL,15,Fformer prime minister was "unable, and
OL,16,Fthe Treasury has been unwilling, to
OL,17,Fcommit the resources that the nation
OL,18,Fneeds to defend the country at this
OL,19,Ftime of rising threats".
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@ZO]qD@AOUrD@WO]wD@[OU{D@WO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FThe Defence Investment Plan (DIP)
OL,7,Fwhich followed ` including a pledge to
OL,8,Ffund the fitting of four Dreadnought
OL,9,Fsubmarines in Barrow ` took expected
OL,10,Ftotal defence investment over the next
OL,11,Ffour years to #298 billion.
OL,13,FDefence spending by the end of the
OL,14,Fdecade will be 2.7% of GDP, according
OL,15,Fto the document.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,FShadow defence secretary James
OL,7,FCartlidge warned the money "would
OL,8,Fappear to be a reannouncement of
OL,9,Ffunding previously confirmed in the
OL,10,FDip", but added: "We nevertheless
OL,11,Fwelcome continued progress on the
OL,12,FDreadnought programme."
OL,14,FThe Conservative frontbencher
OL,15,Fcontinued: "It's concerning that there
OL,16,Fis still no detail at all on the big
OL,17,Fpromise of the strategic defence
OL,18,Freview, which was the procurement of
OL,19,F'up to 12' attack submarines.
OL,26,@oD@\OUrD@DO]rD@ROUtD@WO]wD@LOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36111
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,F"The Dip was meant to clarify exactly
OL,7,Fwhat 'up to 12' meant but we are still
OL,8,Fnone the wiser.
OL,10,F"At the same time, Burnham is adding
OL,11,Fto the uncertainty by failing to
OL,12,Fcommit to the very pathway to 3% which
OL,13,Fhis Chancellor demanded when he
OL,14,Fresigned as defence secretary.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,362,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36112
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785430078
OL,3,CPM to unveil #8.4bn nuclear submarine
OL,4,Cdeal
OL,6,F"It's welcome that we now have a
OL,7,Fconsensus with the Government on
OL,8,Fbacking the nuclear deterrent and it's
OL,9,Fright we send our adversaries the
OL,10,Fmessage that we are all behind the
OL,11,Fworkforce of Barrow and Devonport,
OL,12,Fwhich supports and builds our
OL,13,Fsubmarines.
OL,15,F"Nevertheless, we hope that the
OL,16,FChancellor and Prime Minister will
OL,17,Frespond to the threats we face by
OL,18,Fproperly funding a pathway to 3% (by
OL,19,F2030)."
OL,26,@nD@AOUwD@AOU{D@GO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
